    ["<Assistant_Title1>【事件】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>事件目标：</>城市暗面中会不断发生各类突发事件。参与并完成事件，即可获得悬赏奖励，并推进玩法进度。\n<Assistant_Title2>小贴士：</>优先完成{SendAnswer:剧情事件|879}，可逐步解锁更多{SendAnswer:挑战事件|880}与{SendAnswer:竞技事件|881}，体验完整的城市暗面内容。\n<Assistant_Title2>1.事件类型（包含三种）：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①剧情事件：</>推进剧情，解锁更多玩法内容。\n<Assistant_Title3>②挑战事件：</>完成首领挑战、竞速等玩法，获得丰富奖励，注意：激战·邦尼会根据玩家战力转化属性，影响挑战。\n<Assistant_Title3>③竞技事件：</>参与资源争夺、追逐战，与其他玩家同场竞技。\n<Assistant_Title2>2.事件刷新规则：</>仅会显示当前已解锁且满足开启条件的事件。随着剧情推进，将逐步解锁更多事件。\n<Assistant_Title3>剧情事件：</>完成前置条件后解锁，不会随机刷新。\n<Assistant_Title3>挑战事件：</>满足开启条件后持续刷新，完成后约10秒重新出现。\n<Assistant_Title3>竞技事件：</>每日指定时间开放匹配，匹配成功后开启。\n<Assistant_Title2>3.奖励规则：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①剧情事件：</>完成即可领取奖励。\n<Assistant_Title3>②挑战事件：</>竞速挑战根据排名发放奖励；激战·邦尼根据表现有分档奖励；困难首领事件不设分档奖励。\n<Assistant_Title3>③竞技事件：</>根据最终排名发放奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>4.奖励上限：</>事件奖励领取次数不限，每周可获得的悬赏值存在上限。达到上限后仍可继续参与事件，但不会继续获得悬赏值。\n<Assistant_Title2>5.失败条件：</>\n未在规定时间内完成事件目标。\n事件过程中离开事件区域过远，视为主动放弃。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Event Objective: </> Various sudden events will constantly occur in the dark side of the city. Participate in and complete events to receive bounty rewards and advance gameplay progress. \n<Assistant_Title2> Tips: </> Prioritize completing {SendAnswer: Plot Events | 879 } to gradually unlock more {SendAnswer: Challenge Events | 880 } and {SendAnswer: Competition Events | 881 }, and experience the full content of the city's dark side. \n<Assistant_Title2> 1. Event Types (includes three): </>\n<Assistant_Title3> ① Plot Events: </> Advance the plot and unlock more gameplay content. \n<Assistant_Title3> ② Challenge Events: </> Complete boss challenges, speed runs, and other modes to receive rich rewards. Note: Fierce Battle · Bonnie will convert attributes based on the player's combat power, affecting the challenge. \n<Assistant_Title3> ③ Competition Events: </> Participate in resource contention and chase battles to compete with other players in the same arena. \n<Assistant_Title2> 2. Event Refresh Rules: </> Only events that are currently unlocked and meet the activation conditions will be displayed. As the plot progresses, more events will be unlocked. \n<Assistant_Title3> Plot Events: </> Unlocked after completing prerequisites; they do not refresh randomly. \n<Assistant_Title3> Challenge Events: </> Continuously refresh after meeting activation conditions; they reappear approximately 10 seconds after completion. \n<Assistant_Title3> Competition Events: </> Matching opens at designated times every day; starts after successful matching. \n<Assistant_Title2> 3. Reward Rules: </>\n<Assistant_Title3> ① Plot Events: </> Receive rewards upon completion. \n<Assistant_Title3> ② Challenge Events: </> Speed run challenges distribute rewards based on ranking; Fierce Battle · Bonnie has tiered rewards based on performance; difficult boss events do not have tiered rewards. \n<Assistant_Title3> ③ Competition Events: </> Rewards are distributed based on final ranking. \n<Assistant_Title2> 4. Reward Limit: </> There is no limit to the number of times event rewards can be claimed, but there is a weekly cap on the bounty value that can be obtained. You can continue to participate in events after reaching the cap, but you will not continue to receive bounty value. \n<Assistant_Title2> 5. Failure Conditions: </>\n Failure to complete the event objective within the specified time. \n Leaving the event area too far during the event is considered a voluntary withdrawal.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>新的封印物？</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>获得包含4个非凡词条的装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>A New Sealed Artifact?</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain equipment containing 4 Extraordinary traits",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>珠串缠绕\n黄沙掩埋往昔，祂的凝视穿透时光，烈日的梦从未消散。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Bead String Entwining \n Yellow sand buries the past, His Gaze pierces through time, and the dream of the Blazing Sun has never dissipated.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蝶舞花饰\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Butterfly Flower Ornaments\nIn the midsummer night wonderland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of elves, but also the fluttering poetic heart.",
